WEBVTT

01:35.800 --> 01:37.920
- Mr. Yu!
- Mr. Yu.

01:43.120 --> 01:44.320
One hundred guan.

01:46.920 --> 01:48.520
Nothing less than that.

01:49.320 --> 01:50.520
During the brocade-weaving process,

01:50.600 --> 01:52.640
you may watch,
but please do not interfere.

01:53.840 --> 01:55.560
I will leave it all up to you to decide.

01:55.640 --> 01:56.720
Well…

01:56.800 --> 01:59.320
I wish you both success in your work

01:59.400 --> 02:00.360
and a speedy completion
of the new brocade.

02:11.039 --> 02:14.000
THE YU RESIDENCE

02:23.480 --> 02:25.120
Deep roots, flourishing leaves,

02:25.720 --> 02:27.120
and an endless legacy.

02:30.440 --> 02:33.200
Let us begin the nail-dipping ceremony!

02:43.400 --> 02:44.560
Open the brocade workshop!

03:12.240 --> 03:13.240
Father,

03:14.280 --> 03:17.520
as the silk is not ready,
it cannot go on the loom yet.

03:19.200 --> 03:20.560
I am back.

03:28.840 --> 03:30.480
REFINED PURSUITS

03:30.560 --> 03:31.880
SENTIMENTS EXPRESSED

03:31.960 --> 03:34.080
Has the new brocade been weaved already?

03:34.840 --> 03:37.280
The pattern has not been decided,
so the brocade cannot be woven yet.

03:37.800 --> 03:39.440
They are still selecting threads,
matching colors,

03:39.520 --> 03:40.760
and perfecting the weaving method.

03:40.840 --> 03:42.720
Hopefully,
the pattern will be finished soon.

03:43.240 --> 03:44.160
From what you are saying,

03:44.240 --> 03:47.720
it seems that the pattern
is the core of brocade weaving.

03:48.720 --> 03:50.440
Silk dyeing has its own specific formula,

03:50.520 --> 03:53.400
and the pattern is the formula
for brocade weaving.

03:53.480 --> 03:54.840
With the pattern,

03:54.920 --> 03:57.360
even the most complex brocade
can be woven.

03:57.880 --> 04:02.960
However, I do not believe
that the pattern is the core of brocade.

04:05.320 --> 04:07.280
Why are you looking at me
like that, Mr. Bai?

04:09.600 --> 04:12.280
You are speaking frankly
and from the heart.

04:12.360 --> 04:15.480
I was not expecting you
to share that with me.

04:16.680 --> 04:19.240
This is included in the 100 guan
you paid me.

04:19.760 --> 04:22.400
In business, I have always been fair
and honest with everyone.

04:23.000 --> 04:23.920
With your character,

04:24.000 --> 04:26.080
you are bound to achieve
great things in the future!

04:26.600 --> 04:28.800
Still, I cannot help but wonder.

04:29.320 --> 04:32.720
Why would a woman like you
indulge in this field?

04:35.000 --> 04:37.240
That question is not
within the scope of the 100 guan.

04:39.640 --> 04:42.600
Okay then. I will ask
something else within the scope.

04:43.400 --> 04:45.520
What is the core of brocade weaving?

04:46.920 --> 04:49.880
I will not be able to answer that.

04:50.400 --> 04:53.040
Everyone has a different answer to it.

04:53.680 --> 04:57.200
They should be working on selecting
the threads and matching the colors now.

04:57.280 --> 04:59.280
- Please come with me, Mr. Bai.
- After you.

05:00.720 --> 05:03.840
This green is a mix
of indigo and gardenia,

05:03.920 --> 05:05.520
perfectly capturing
the fresh greenery of wheat!

05:05.600 --> 05:08.480
- He is right.
- The green you picked is too dark!

05:09.200 --> 05:11.400
Mine is much brighter and clearer!

05:11.480 --> 05:13.240
- It is indeed brighter.
- Since we are making a shimmering brocade,

05:13.320 --> 05:15.680
- it needs to be bright and stunning!
- Wait, I think…

05:15.760 --> 05:18.200
Since we are aiming for something new,
we should innovate,

05:18.280 --> 05:19.640
- right?
- Wait! Wait! Can I offer some advice?

05:19.720 --> 05:22.760
These two colors are quite similar.
How about we roll the dice to decide?

05:22.840 --> 05:24.000
- Shut up!
- Shut up!

05:26.480 --> 05:27.720
Ms. Ji. Mr. Bai.

05:29.920 --> 05:31.920
You are right on time.
Please decide for us.

05:32.560 --> 05:34.680
- Which is better?
- Talk it over among yourselves,

05:34.760 --> 05:35.720
and do not get upset.

05:35.800 --> 05:38.720
I will take Mr. Bai to…
the workshop to take a look.

05:38.800 --> 05:40.680
Come with me, Mr. Bai.

05:40.760 --> 05:41.680
Yingying!

05:43.400 --> 05:45.720
Disagreements are inevitable
when two different parties work together.

05:45.800 --> 05:48.000
Let us head to the workshop now.
My brother is there.

05:48.080 --> 05:50.480
He likes to study.
He is technically a scholar.

05:50.560 --> 05:51.400
Okay.

05:51.480 --> 05:53.640
Why can we not use the old method then?

05:53.720 --> 05:57.200
- It is possible, but…
- What is wrong with it?

05:57.280 --> 05:59.480
But to achieve the flowing ripple effect,

05:59.560 --> 06:01.560
I think we should use colors instead.

06:01.640 --> 06:04.600
- Yingying is good at matching colors.
- I think…

06:04.680 --> 06:07.600
the wheat stalks should be done
in satin weave.

06:07.680 --> 06:08.640
Satin weave?

06:08.720 --> 06:11.160
Plain weave is the best
for basic but delicate patterns!

06:11.880 --> 06:14.480
That is it.
You are useless. Stay out of this.

06:14.560 --> 06:16.440
Excuse me? Watch your mouth.

06:16.520 --> 06:17.680
Do you even know who I am?

06:17.760 --> 06:19.440
This place belongs to the Yu family.

06:19.520 --> 06:21.360
Are you sure?

06:21.440 --> 06:23.360
I am almost certain
that it will become part of Bloom

06:23.440 --> 06:25.440
pretty soon.

06:25.960 --> 06:27.120
Excuse me, the Ji family!

06:27.920 --> 06:29.560
Where did that come from?

06:29.640 --> 06:31.520
Why would you say that it belongs
to the Ji family or Bloom?

06:31.600 --> 06:33.080
- It belongs to the Yu family.
- Is this

06:33.160 --> 06:35.800
- what you meant by true teamwork, Ms. Ji?
- Isn't it obvious?

06:38.920 --> 06:41.560
It seems that I will not be
getting back my investment.

07:14.720 --> 07:18.680
The table is filled with delicacies.
Why are none of you trying it out?

07:22.960 --> 07:26.600
I am too upset to have any appetite.

07:33.760 --> 07:36.480
Since no one is hungry,
shall we play a game then?

07:36.560 --> 07:38.080
Yes! What kind of game?

07:44.960 --> 07:47.680
You shall ask a question
about the brocade business.

07:47.760 --> 07:51.520
If my brother answers correctly,
each of you will earn one wen.

07:51.600 --> 07:53.600
Then, my brother will ask you a question,
and you answer it.

07:53.680 --> 07:55.240
The more you answer, the more you earn!

07:55.840 --> 07:59.560
The game continues until someone falls
or the board touches the ground.

08:00.080 --> 08:01.480
Sir, what is your question?

08:02.080 --> 08:03.400
The number of chopsticks

08:03.480 --> 08:05.880
represents the count
for Shu brocade's cardinal colors.

08:07.080 --> 08:08.160
Shu brocade's cardinal colors?

08:08.240 --> 08:12.440
There are five colors.
Red, yellow, blue, white, and black.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.840
Yes! You got it!

08:14.920 --> 08:16.560
Here, it is your turn to ask!

08:17.360 --> 08:18.520
The binary colors.

08:18.600 --> 08:22.320
The binary colors of Shu brocade
are red, green, blue, and purple,

08:22.400 --> 08:23.240
making four in total.

08:23.880 --> 08:24.840
Excellent!

08:24.920 --> 08:26.880
Another correct answer!
Two wen in total now!

08:26.960 --> 08:28.440
Hold as long as you can!

08:29.280 --> 08:32.080
Whoever answers the most
will earn an additional three wen.

08:32.159 --> 08:33.159
Let us go!

08:35.520 --> 08:37.840
How many patterns were featured

08:37.919 --> 08:40.960
in the Five Stars Rising
in the East brocade from the Han Dynasty?

08:41.039 --> 08:42.039
Five.

08:43.600 --> 08:45.160
How is it five patterns?

08:45.680 --> 08:47.000
- Is it five?
- You…

08:47.680 --> 08:48.800
Think carefully.

08:49.600 --> 08:51.040
It is five patterns.

08:51.120 --> 08:52.280
You… You!

08:53.080 --> 08:55.040
Think, will you?

08:56.040 --> 08:58.640
Hold on tight! Hold it!

09:03.640 --> 09:04.720
Are you okay?

09:04.800 --> 09:06.600
It is four patterns!

09:07.200 --> 09:09.040
Seriously, do you even
know about brocades?

09:09.840 --> 09:11.400
Grass lizards, talisman tigers,

09:11.480 --> 09:13.360
suns, moons, and the white-colored
small seal scriptures.

09:14.320 --> 09:15.880
The white-colored small seal scriptures
are included?

09:16.480 --> 09:20.040
The white-colored small seal scriptures?
That is included?

09:21.120 --> 09:22.920
The characters are part of the pattern.

09:29.040 --> 09:34.080
I meant to test you,
but now it is me who has…

09:37.080 --> 09:40.080
- shown my weakness.
- I have made a fool of myself.

09:40.160 --> 09:42.680
Congratulations to both of you
for getting two wen!

09:44.480 --> 09:45.440
Two wen!

09:47.800 --> 09:49.160
- Here.
- I am rich now!

09:51.960 --> 09:54.000
People in the Shu brocade business
are straightforward!

09:54.080 --> 09:55.320
If there is a question, we will ask it,

09:55.400 --> 09:57.560
and if there is a disagreement,
we will settle it through competition.

09:57.640 --> 09:59.240
But we must remember,

09:59.320 --> 10:03.560
whatever we do,
it is all to create new brocade.

10:04.320 --> 10:08.960
Remember, we succeed and profit
only by supporting each other!

10:09.640 --> 10:10.880
- Yes! Well said!
- Yes.

10:11.480 --> 10:13.560
- That is right.
- We win and we make money.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.360
Anyone else want to play the game?

10:17.880 --> 10:20.120
Mr. Li, shall we?

10:20.200 --> 10:22.360
Okay. Let us do it!

10:22.440 --> 10:23.680
I will ask the question!

10:24.640 --> 10:25.880
Let me do it instead.

10:31.120 --> 10:33.640
Exchanging knowledge,
deepening understanding,

10:33.720 --> 10:34.680
and building closer connections.

10:35.280 --> 10:37.240
You truly live up to your name, Ms. Ji.

10:37.320 --> 10:39.640
This three-in-one approach
is indeed a great method.

10:43.240 --> 10:44.080
By the way,

10:45.160 --> 10:46.320
there was a question just now

10:46.400 --> 10:49.880
about what is most important
in the Shu brocade business.

10:49.960 --> 10:55.280
I am sure
that your answer is unity, right?

10:59.280 --> 11:00.200
Yes!

11:01.880 --> 11:03.080
Unity.

11:04.040 --> 11:05.320
People are the core.

11:05.400 --> 11:07.000
The patterns and the loom are lifeless.

11:07.080 --> 11:09.480
Only in the hands of skilled artisans
do they come to life.

11:09.560 --> 11:13.960
Whatever your plans are, please remember
to value these craftsmen, Mr. Bai.

11:15.640 --> 11:17.680
- I will keep that in mind.
- Mr. Li won!

11:17.760 --> 11:19.400
Do not worry, Ms. Ji.

11:19.480 --> 11:21.160
Give me the money! I won!

11:21.240 --> 11:22.680
Why are you asking me?
You should be giving me the money!

11:22.760 --> 11:25.640
- Next! Who will be the next one?
- What is it, Mr. Chen?

11:28.040 --> 11:31.200
Ms. Ji, Mr. Bai, have a try.

11:31.800 --> 11:33.920
- Mr. Bai and I will not be participating.
- Wait!

11:37.720 --> 11:43.560
Anyway, I guess I am now
somewhat part of the brocade business.

11:44.080 --> 11:45.600
Why not give it a try?

11:46.600 --> 11:48.000
- Give it a try, Ji Yingying!
- Give it a try.

11:48.080 --> 11:50.200
- Yes! Give it a try!
- Give it a try!

11:50.280 --> 11:51.840
- Try it.
- Just try.

11:51.920 --> 11:54.520
- Very well. Let us give it a try.
- After you.

12:01.360 --> 12:02.360
Watch out.

12:09.440 --> 12:10.920
My question is,

12:11.600 --> 12:13.800
how sincere are you
about wanting to be friends with me?

12:17.040 --> 12:18.960
Your question
is not about the brocade business.

12:19.560 --> 12:22.240
You just said that the people are the most
important thing in the brocade business.

12:22.920 --> 12:25.760
So, asking about the heart
is naturally part of it.

12:25.840 --> 12:30.520
If you do not answer,
you will be hurting my sincere heart.

12:31.120 --> 12:32.240
Ten chopsticks!

12:34.000 --> 12:36.200
Ten chopsticks? Really?

12:37.320 --> 12:41.280
Did you fail to sense my utmost sincerity
in doing business with you, Mr. Bai?

12:42.760 --> 12:44.800
You are hurting my sincere heart.

12:47.720 --> 12:52.520
Very well then. I have lost this round.
But please give me another chance.

12:53.040 --> 12:55.040
- You can ask the question.
- Okay!

12:57.040 --> 13:00.720
I would like to ask, how many days
will you be staying in Yizhou, Mr. Bai?

13:03.440 --> 13:05.640
Is this within the scope
of the brocade business as well?

13:06.600 --> 13:08.560
The core of the brocade business
is the people.

13:08.640 --> 13:10.800
Since you are an important figure here,

13:10.880 --> 13:12.880
this naturally relates
to the brocade business.

13:13.400 --> 13:14.600
You are right.

13:14.680 --> 13:17.680
Well, I should think carefully
about the answer.

13:21.360 --> 13:24.560
Ms. Ji, make sure you grab the rope.
Hold on tight.

13:36.920 --> 13:37.920
What are you doing here?

13:38.720 --> 13:40.480
I am sharing the joy with the people!

13:41.080 --> 13:43.480
I have not finished my round with Ms. Ji.

13:43.560 --> 13:47.080
If you wish to participate, Mr. Yang,
you should wait for a moment.

13:47.160 --> 13:50.440
From what I see, this round
should have ended a while ago.

14:04.040 --> 14:07.520
Both of you, I, Ji Yingying, am a person,

14:07.600 --> 14:09.200
not an item that you can try to snatch
from one another!

14:09.280 --> 14:12.320
I will not be going anywhere
just because you ask me either!

14:12.840 --> 14:15.080
Since you two love this game so much,
you should both play instead.

14:18.080 --> 14:18.920
Sorry, I was being rude.

14:20.720 --> 14:21.960
I'm sorry.

14:32.240 --> 14:33.520
Thank you for walking toward me, Ms. Ji.

14:35.960 --> 14:37.200
Yang Jinglan,

14:37.720 --> 14:40.600
is the silk thread in your hands
the Flushed Rose that I dyed?

14:42.320 --> 14:44.720
- Flushed Rose!
- Yes.

14:47.120 --> 14:48.440
I had no other choice.

14:49.240 --> 14:52.720
Do you know how much effort it took me
to dye this silk thread?

14:53.440 --> 14:54.360
- Yeah!
- So much work!

14:54.440 --> 14:56.520
- It took days!
- It was so much work!

14:59.560 --> 15:01.480
How about I compensate you?

15:01.560 --> 15:02.960
Compensate me, you say?

15:03.480 --> 15:04.480
That will not do.

15:06.280 --> 15:07.280
I will double it.

15:07.800 --> 15:09.160
Is that good enough?

15:09.240 --> 15:11.440
- No way!
- Doubling it is not enough.

15:11.520 --> 15:12.880
I will triple it.
That is the most I can do.

15:12.960 --> 15:14.040
You will triple it?

15:14.120 --> 15:15.760
Those who are caught up in emotions

15:16.400 --> 15:17.680
cannot achieve great things.

15:39.480 --> 15:42.600
THE YU RESIDENCE

15:57.280 --> 15:59.520
Ms. Ji, you have been working hard.
Why not take a break for lunch?

16:00.920 --> 16:02.120
What are you doing here?

16:03.120 --> 16:06.280
I have come to apologize
for mishandling the silk thread

16:06.360 --> 16:08.440
and disrespecting your hard work.

16:10.040 --> 16:10.880
What is that?

16:18.040 --> 16:19.280
Take a seat and give it a try.

16:24.880 --> 16:25.920
Be careful.

16:27.720 --> 16:29.560
Push back with your legs.

16:34.640 --> 16:36.000
This is interesting.

16:36.080 --> 16:38.640
But… what is the use of this?

16:38.720 --> 16:41.160
Put this in the brocade workshop.

16:41.240 --> 16:43.120
You can sit on it
and move around with ease.

16:43.200 --> 16:45.800
It will help you save some energy
and keep you entertained.

16:45.880 --> 16:48.120
- Did you make this yourself?
- Yes.

16:48.960 --> 16:52.600
Can you forgive me now
for mishandling Flushed Rose?

16:54.280 --> 16:55.520
Fine. I will let it slide this time.

16:57.160 --> 16:58.920
But that is not all I am here for today.

16:59.000 --> 17:02.480
I have another favor to ask of you.

17:02.560 --> 17:03.400
What is it?

17:05.119 --> 17:05.960
Teach me about brocade.

17:13.480 --> 17:15.160
Is it because you have to deliver
the tribute brocade?

17:17.920 --> 17:19.200
It is because

17:20.400 --> 17:23.359
I want to see the world as you do.

17:42.640 --> 17:44.560
Take a seat. I will get the brocade.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.560
Cover your eyes.

17:53.960 --> 17:54.800
What for?

17:54.880 --> 17:56.560
Do you not wish
to learn how to identify brocade?

17:58.640 --> 18:02.240
Ms. Ji, you sure have a unique method
for identifying brocade.

18:03.360 --> 18:06.040
A true expert does not rely
solely on their eyes to identify brocade.

18:07.320 --> 18:08.200
They must use their heart.

18:09.280 --> 18:10.240
Yeah.

18:21.920 --> 18:23.120
It is done.

18:25.520 --> 18:26.680
Can you see?

18:39.480 --> 18:40.800
Ji Yingying, stop right there.

18:46.400 --> 18:47.320
I am ready.

18:59.520 --> 19:02.520
Alright.
Let us begin with our first brocade.

19:13.920 --> 19:14.760
Touch it.

19:15.840 --> 19:17.360
Take your time to truly feel it.

19:19.320 --> 19:20.480
Can you identify it?

19:23.280 --> 19:26.240
How can you identify this brocade
just by blindly feeling it?

19:40.640 --> 19:41.960
This is a petal.

19:42.720 --> 19:44.320
It unfurls in layer.

19:45.040 --> 19:46.760
This is a stamen.

19:47.800 --> 19:49.320
The weaving is delicate.

19:53.960 --> 19:57.960
This is a leaf and a vine.
Flowers bloom on all six sides.

19:58.480 --> 20:00.960
There are leaves among the flowers
and flowers nestled in the leaves.

20:01.040 --> 20:02.280
Layer upon layer,

20:03.000 --> 20:05.040
the pattern unfolds evenly.

20:06.680 --> 20:08.280
Take a moment to feel it again.

20:15.880 --> 20:17.680
This is the Lotus Blossom Brocade.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.240
Nicely done!

20:22.960 --> 20:24.880
Alright. Let us move on to the next.

20:42.000 --> 20:43.960
It looks like being blindfolded

20:45.720 --> 20:47.000
really muddles your thoughts.

20:51.280 --> 20:53.000
Yang Jinglan, I…

21:21.360 --> 21:22.560
If you are willing,

21:24.560 --> 21:26.000
I will slowly come to you.

21:30.320 --> 21:31.560
If not,

21:35.520 --> 21:37.120
I will wait until you are ready.

21:46.000 --> 21:48.200
- Yang Jinglan…
- I am here.

21:49.680 --> 21:52.800
You are stepping on my foot. It hurts.

22:07.000 --> 22:09.480
How about we try again?

22:11.200 --> 22:14.280
I… I mean, let us identify the brocade.

22:52.200 --> 22:54.120
It looks like being blindfolded

22:55.920 --> 22:57.600
really muddles your thoughts.

23:02.640 --> 23:03.720
If you are willing,

23:05.640 --> 23:06.800
I will slowly come to you.

23:08.800 --> 23:11.720
If not, I will wait until you are ready.

23:16.920 --> 23:18.880
Guo Kui, stop barking!

23:32.760 --> 23:37.040
THE ZHAO RESIDENCE

23:50.240 --> 23:52.280
Dear, you sure are thorough.

23:52.360 --> 23:55.200
You are personally checking
the brocade before its delivery.

24:03.360 --> 24:04.280
What are you doing?

24:04.920 --> 24:07.160
You have been working hard
these past few days

24:07.240 --> 24:09.600
and overseeing the brocade daily.

24:09.680 --> 24:10.800
How could anything go wrong?

24:12.160 --> 24:14.760
The servants can handle
the brocade delivery out of the city.

24:14.840 --> 24:16.800
You really ought to get some rest.

24:26.080 --> 24:28.160
I am just reminding you

24:29.000 --> 24:32.920
to stay out of the brocade delivery.

24:34.680 --> 24:38.360
Have you forgotten how Master Ji died?

24:40.560 --> 24:42.640
- Load the carriage.
- Yes, sir.

24:51.600 --> 24:54.320
My dear, this will be a dangerous journey.

24:54.840 --> 24:56.360
Be careful out there.

24:59.760 --> 25:02.840
I will be going with you
to deliver the brocade.

25:04.840 --> 25:06.640
The list of people
handling the brocade delivery

25:06.720 --> 25:08.000
has already been finalized.

25:08.520 --> 25:11.240
Even though you are the Brocade Master,
you cannot come with me.

25:11.320 --> 25:13.720
This has been done
by past Brocade Masters.

25:14.320 --> 25:15.760
It is just a matter of choice.

25:15.840 --> 25:18.680
Do not try to force my hand
with that official document.

25:19.280 --> 25:21.440
Fine. Do as you wish. Let us go!

25:28.600 --> 25:29.440
Here.

25:33.800 --> 25:35.040
Why are you here?

25:36.040 --> 25:38.720
I wish to personally deliver
the Shu Red Silk I have dyed.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.720
Just wait for me to return.

25:40.800 --> 25:45.360
Back then, my father was killed
because of Shu Red Silk.

25:46.240 --> 25:47.680
Yang Jinglan, I am worried about you.

25:49.520 --> 25:51.720
Even if you will not bring me along,
I will still follow you.

25:53.040 --> 25:54.120
Ms. Ji,

25:54.640 --> 25:55.840
I truly need you.

25:55.920 --> 25:56.880
However, this time,

25:56.960 --> 25:59.480
I need you to stay in Yizhou
and not by my side.

26:00.320 --> 26:02.480
- You need me to stay in Yizhou?
- Yes.

26:03.440 --> 26:07.600
If I get tired from the journey,
I would like to come back home.

26:09.640 --> 26:10.880
Okay?

26:11.960 --> 26:12.880
Please, Ms. Ji.

26:27.360 --> 26:30.200
General,
we have received word from Yizhou.

26:30.280 --> 26:31.120
Yang Jinglan and the rest

26:31.200 --> 26:33.080
are making their way to Chang'an
with the tribute brocade.

27:05.440 --> 27:09.480
Please keep him safe.

27:10.600 --> 27:12.160
He is a good officer.

27:13.000 --> 27:16.200
He is vital to Yizhou

27:17.880 --> 27:20.160
and someone I deeply care about.

27:21.640 --> 27:23.360
I pray for his safety.

27:36.160 --> 27:37.440
Ms. Ji.

27:39.360 --> 27:41.640
Mr. Bai, what brings you here?

27:42.160 --> 27:47.200
I was having a drink at San Hua Pavilion
and happened to see you rushing past.

27:47.280 --> 27:48.360
I thought something had happened.

27:49.720 --> 27:51.240
Thank you for your concern.

27:51.760 --> 27:52.600
Oh, right,

27:53.600 --> 27:57.480
the shop had just two left,
so I bought them all.

27:58.080 --> 27:59.760
Here is the last one. You can have it.

28:01.320 --> 28:02.480
This is…?

28:02.560 --> 28:04.360
This is a tradition in Yizhou.

28:04.440 --> 28:07.600
After making a wish,
you throw the red ribbon on the tree.

28:07.680 --> 28:09.360
It is believed
to keep your loved ones safe

28:09.440 --> 28:11.080
and a way to send your thoughts to them.

28:15.520 --> 28:18.080
I do not have anyone I miss.

28:22.600 --> 28:26.280
Everyone has to face
a lonely, cold path at some point,

28:26.880 --> 28:29.280
but life will not always stay that way.

28:30.240 --> 28:31.400
Give it a shot.

28:31.920 --> 28:33.520
You could wish

28:33.600 --> 28:37.000
for someone worthy
of your thoughts one day.

28:47.320 --> 28:48.160
Alright, then.

28:49.960 --> 28:54.400
To be honest, I do not believe
in deities or making wishes.

28:55.520 --> 28:58.880
How about you make a wish for me, Ms. Ji?

29:04.720 --> 29:10.120
I have made wishes for my mother, Yaoting,
Mr. Chen, and Ms. Zhu before.

29:10.640 --> 29:13.440
But they are my close family and friends.

29:15.800 --> 29:18.520
As for you, Mr. Bai,
we are not quite there yet.

29:22.800 --> 29:25.400
We have known each other for some time.

29:25.920 --> 29:28.160
We have made deals
and shared moments of camaraderie.

29:29.000 --> 29:30.640
But as a friend,

29:31.240 --> 29:34.280
I find you not entirely honest.

29:40.560 --> 29:43.120
Let us stick to business, shall we?
Farewell.

29:50.720 --> 29:53.880
Make your own wish.
Sincerity is what counts.

30:42.440 --> 30:44.880
RELAY STATION

30:49.600 --> 30:51.080
Mr. Yang, thank you for your hard work.

30:51.160 --> 30:52.920
Long time no see, sir.

30:53.640 --> 30:55.120
It is late.

30:55.200 --> 30:57.960
Please rest here at the inn tonight,
Mr. Yang.

30:58.040 --> 30:59.800
Tomorrow morning,
we will set off to inspect the brocade.

31:00.480 --> 31:02.240
- Very well.
- This way, please.

31:14.840 --> 31:15.760
Hurry!

31:17.000 --> 31:19.160
Replace all the tribute brocade
with the fakes.

31:27.160 --> 31:28.520
If you want to blame someone,

31:28.600 --> 31:31.320
blame yourself
for offending the wrong person!

31:32.440 --> 31:33.640
Are you talking about me?

31:36.720 --> 31:37.920
Do not move!

31:40.320 --> 31:41.720
Mr. Yang?

31:42.880 --> 31:46.440
You have swapped the tribute brocade
and attacked me, logistics officer.

31:46.520 --> 31:47.840
This is a capital offense.

31:48.600 --> 31:52.360
At this point, stop accusing others
to cover up your own crime.

31:53.760 --> 31:55.240
Instead, you should reflect on this.

31:55.320 --> 31:57.520
Your plan was so meticulous.

31:57.600 --> 32:01.760
If someone did not betray you,
I would not have caught you red-handed.

32:04.840 --> 32:06.880
I have no idea what you are talking about.

32:08.080 --> 32:10.440
You know that I am at odds with Niu Jin.

32:11.240 --> 32:13.800
Niu Jin wields absolute power in Yizhou.

32:13.880 --> 32:14.920
But tell me,

32:15.000 --> 32:16.720
why do you think
he does not dare to kill me?

32:19.240 --> 32:21.560
It is because he fears
the person backing me.

32:23.640 --> 32:26.240
The person backing you? Who is it?

32:28.760 --> 32:29.720
Tell them to get inside.

32:32.360 --> 32:33.280
Go inside!

32:34.520 --> 32:35.520
Shut the door!

32:43.320 --> 32:46.360
Mr. Yang, can you tell me now?

32:51.680 --> 32:53.920
The person backing me is not important.

32:54.440 --> 32:55.760
What matters is this.

32:56.440 --> 32:58.240
Niu Jin does not dare
make a move against me

32:58.320 --> 33:02.520
because he needs to give both me
and the person behind me an explanation.

33:04.280 --> 33:06.200
Do you still remember Ji Guinan, sir?

33:09.040 --> 33:10.800
When the truth was revealed,

33:12.280 --> 33:13.880
he became the scapegoat.

33:13.960 --> 33:16.000
Does that sound eerily familiar
to what is happening now?

33:17.240 --> 33:19.920
I do not understand what you are saying!

33:21.400 --> 33:24.120
After what happened to Ji Guinan,

33:24.640 --> 33:26.080
you stopped transporting
tribute brocade altogether.

33:27.480 --> 33:30.240
Yet now that I am here,
you have suddenly returned to the role.

33:30.320 --> 33:33.800
Niu Jin wants you to die by my hand

33:34.480 --> 33:37.240
or I die by yours.

33:37.320 --> 33:39.080
With that, he can close the case.

33:39.600 --> 33:44.120
If that is true,
then why have you not acted yet?

33:45.240 --> 33:47.840
I do not wish for both of us to lose,
only for Niu Jin to benefit.

33:49.640 --> 33:52.160
Moreover, you were only
following orders back then.

33:52.240 --> 33:55.520
Killing you is not enough
to bring peace to the departed.

33:56.960 --> 33:59.920
What if you and I joined forces?

34:00.880 --> 34:03.920
No matter who I collaborate with,
death is the only outcome.

34:04.520 --> 34:09.040
There is a difference between one death
and the death of an entire family.

34:10.360 --> 34:11.360
What do you think?

34:13.840 --> 34:15.320
Be careful!

34:18.760 --> 34:19.800
Whose men are those?

34:22.360 --> 34:24.480
It seems that I underestimated Niu Jin.

34:24.560 --> 34:27.840
He does not just want one of us dead.
He wants us both dead here!

34:28.840 --> 34:32.159
Later, you will be said
to have swapped the tribute brocade

34:32.239 --> 34:33.960
and I risked my life to catch you.

34:34.040 --> 34:37.199
You take the blame for his crime,
and I die in the act of apprehending you.

34:37.960 --> 34:41.199
At this point, do you still not see
that this is a death trap?

34:41.280 --> 34:44.719
Collaborating with me
is your only way out.

34:50.320 --> 34:51.760
Have you not figured it out yet?

34:55.520 --> 34:59.320
Now that it has come to this,
I will collaborate with you!

35:00.400 --> 35:03.640
I am willing to write a confession
for my role in the tribute brocade affair

35:03.720 --> 35:04.880
and expose the traitors.

35:04.960 --> 35:07.720
But in return, you must guarantee
the safety of my wife and daughter.

35:08.800 --> 35:11.440
Very well. I promise you.

35:18.840 --> 35:20.840
Yang Jinglan has captured
the logistics officer.

35:21.960 --> 35:23.920
Take 100 elite soldiers
and head north immediately.

35:24.000 --> 35:26.640
You must intercept them
before they reach Shannan Road.

35:26.720 --> 35:28.240
Leave no survivors.

35:29.400 --> 35:30.800
What about Mr. Zhao?

35:31.440 --> 35:34.680
- I said, leave no survivors!
- Yes, sir!

36:10.040 --> 36:12.840
Yang Jinglan captured
the logistics officer two days ago.

36:12.920 --> 36:15.280
How is it that they have only just reached
Shannan Road today?

36:15.360 --> 36:18.360
They are moving so slowly
and not concealing their tracks.

36:18.440 --> 36:20.040
This has to be bait.

36:20.680 --> 36:22.320
So, General, you are saying…

36:23.760 --> 36:26.000
Mobilize our men immediately.
We return to Yizhou at once.

36:27.040 --> 36:27.920
Yes, sir.

36:32.920 --> 36:33.960
Ms. Ji,

36:35.440 --> 36:37.040
may I have a word with you?

36:38.440 --> 36:42.960
Master Gao, where is Yang Jinglan?
Has something happened to him?

36:43.040 --> 36:44.400
Ms. Ji,

36:45.720 --> 36:48.320
Mr. Yang risked his life this time
and took such a dangerous gamble.

36:48.400 --> 36:51.560
It is because
he wants to clear your father's name.

36:52.160 --> 36:53.400
He convinced the military commissioner

36:54.080 --> 36:56.240
to assign the logistics officer
who was involved in your father's case

36:56.320 --> 36:57.480
- to handle this current shipment.
- Mr. Yang.

36:57.560 --> 36:58.240
- Sir.
- This was to lure Niu Jin

36:58.320 --> 36:59.720
into making a move.

36:59.800 --> 37:02.240
Then, he used the opportunity
to capture the logistics officer,

37:02.320 --> 37:04.920
tricking him into believing that Niu Jin
planned to make him the scapegoat.

37:05.000 --> 37:08.080
Then, we disguised ourselves
as assassins sent by Niu Jin

37:08.160 --> 37:09.520
to make the deception more convincing

37:09.600 --> 37:10.920
- and force the logistics officer.
- Collaborating with me

37:11.000 --> 37:12.440
is your only way out.

37:13.080 --> 37:16.120
Then, he took a fake logistics officer
to Chang'an,

37:16.200 --> 37:17.560
drawing Niu Jin's attention away from us.

37:17.640 --> 37:19.360
What about the real logistics officer?

37:21.400 --> 37:23.600
- Did you bring him back to Yizhou?
- Yes.

37:24.240 --> 37:26.920
Initially, we planned to hide him
in a secure location.

37:27.600 --> 37:29.320
But we just received news

37:29.400 --> 37:33.280
that Niu Jin is leading a large troop
and is heading toward Yizhou.

37:33.880 --> 37:37.320
He has seen through our plan
much sooner than Yang Jinglan anticipated.

37:37.400 --> 37:39.000
If he starts searching,

37:39.920 --> 37:41.640
we will not be able to keep
the real logistics officer hidden.

37:43.240 --> 37:44.920
Yang Jinglan told me

37:45.000 --> 37:48.000
that if anything unexpected happens,
I should come to you, Ms. Ji.

37:57.160 --> 37:58.280
Stop!

38:02.320 --> 38:03.760
It is time.

38:04.320 --> 38:06.360
Turn around!
We are heading back to Yizhou!

38:08.120 --> 38:09.640
- Come! Come and have a look.
- New brocade pre-orders

38:09.720 --> 38:10.800
from Bloom Society!

38:10.880 --> 38:14.080
All interested buyers who attend the event
will receive a complimentary pouch.

38:14.160 --> 38:16.000
- First come, first served!
- Let us go!

38:16.080 --> 38:18.880
Bloom Society's pouches
are exquisitely crafted, durable,

38:18.960 --> 38:21.400
and have a uniquely pleasant fragrance.

38:23.920 --> 38:26.960
The carriage is here!
The carriage is here! Make way!

38:49.400 --> 38:51.800
Ji Guinan is hereby sentenced
to immediate execution

38:51.880 --> 38:53.080
for presenting inferior goods as tribute,

38:53.160 --> 38:56.000
deceiving the emperor,
and resisting arrest!

39:03.360 --> 39:04.600
Everyone,

39:05.560 --> 39:08.920
the logistics officer has been arrested
for dereliction of duty and theft.

39:09.000 --> 39:11.200
This matter threatens
the entire brocade industry of Yizhou.

39:11.280 --> 39:13.720
To protect the interests
of the brocade merchants,

39:13.800 --> 39:16.120
I, Zhuge Hong,
representing Brocade Bureau,

39:16.200 --> 39:18.200
will now interrogate the accused

39:18.280 --> 39:22.000
to ensure that justice is served.

39:26.040 --> 39:29.160
What crimes have you committed?
Speak truthfully!

39:32.840 --> 39:35.040
While transporting the tribute brocade,

39:35.120 --> 39:37.680
I swapped the real goods for inferior ones

39:37.760 --> 39:40.680
to seek personal gain.

39:40.760 --> 39:43.760
Mr. Yang discovered my actions
and caught me red-handed.

39:45.120 --> 39:47.760
Swapping tribute brocade
is an unforgivable crime!

39:48.440 --> 39:51.960
With such audacity,
there must be someone else behind this.

39:57.920 --> 40:01.240
No one gave me the orders. I acted alone.

40:07.000 --> 40:09.000
You have been a logistics officer
for years.

40:09.080 --> 40:11.280
How many times
have you committed this crime before?

40:12.680 --> 40:13.800
Ten years ago,

40:13.880 --> 40:15.960
in the case of Ji Guinan's alleged
corruption over the tribute brocade,

40:16.040 --> 40:17.520
it was my doing.

40:18.080 --> 40:20.280
I framed Ji Guinan.

40:20.360 --> 40:23.360
He knew nothing about the embezzlement.

41:03.800 --> 41:05.920
I was not expecting you
to come in person, General Niu.

41:06.440 --> 41:07.480
How may I help you?

41:07.560 --> 41:09.800
The logistics officer
is a soldier of Yizhou's military.

41:09.880 --> 41:11.800
Even if he broke the law,

41:11.880 --> 41:14.240
he should be handed over to the military.

41:14.880 --> 41:18.640
How is it proper for Brocade Bureau
to make such a spectacle?

41:19.600 --> 41:21.400
General Niu, your reasoning is flawed.

41:21.920 --> 41:23.680
This man swapped tribute brocade

41:23.760 --> 41:26.400
and undermined Yizhou's brocade industry.

41:27.000 --> 41:29.000
He must be tried publicly,

41:29.080 --> 41:31.200
in front of every brocade merchant
in Yizhou,

41:31.720 --> 41:33.400
to ensure a fair and transparent inquiry.

41:34.080 --> 41:36.400
Ms. Ji, this man is ruthless.

41:36.480 --> 41:37.960
Leave him to us.

41:38.040 --> 41:41.600
If anything were to happen to you today,
how would I explain it to Mr. Yang?

41:42.920 --> 41:45.480
My father was falsely accused for years.

41:46.320 --> 41:50.640
I believe in justice and the law.
It will give us the truth we deserve.

41:52.320 --> 41:53.320
You are no officer.

41:53.400 --> 41:55.800
Your baseless accusations
and incitement of the people

41:56.560 --> 41:58.560
are punishable by death!

41:58.640 --> 42:00.440
- Take them all away!
- Yes, sir!

42:00.520 --> 42:03.320
Wait! I am here under Mr. Yang's orders.

42:05.880 --> 42:08.640
What authority does Brocade Bureau have
to investigate someone from my army?

42:08.720 --> 42:10.520
- Take them away!
- Yes, sir!

42:10.600 --> 42:11.760
Hold on…!

42:12.280 --> 42:13.120
General Niu…

42:13.640 --> 42:17.840
Everyone, the tribute brocade
is a treasure beloved by His Majesty.

42:17.920 --> 42:20.280
It is the labor of countless silk
and brocade artisans.

42:20.360 --> 42:22.200
It is the pride of Yizhou.

42:22.800 --> 42:24.520
Now, it has been tarnished
by traitorous hands,

42:24.600 --> 42:26.080
bringing shame upon us all.

42:26.600 --> 42:28.920
Should we not demand an explanation?

42:29.000 --> 42:31.880
- Exactly!
- We deserve an explanation!

42:32.480 --> 42:35.560
General Niu, please investigate thoroughly
and seek justice for the people!
